{
    "title": "Fox News - Daily Breaking News",
    "description": "Stay informed this election season with the FOX News App. Get the latest on polls with reporting from both sides of the aisle and breaking news from the campaign trail. Bret Baier and Martha MacCallum report on the issues and where each presidential candidate stands, every step of the way. Find out who our next president is with FOX News. Democracy \u201924\u2014Your freedom. Your vote.\r\n\r\nGet your news, however you want: \r\n-\tWATCH LIVESTREAM OR ON-DEMAND VIDEOS. Enjoy your favorite FOX News tv shows while browsing the smart app, with picture-in-picture viewing. Your world, reported live\u2014with all your favorite shows:\r\n-\tFOX & Friends\u2014the #1 morning show on cable\r\n-\tSpecial Report\r\n-\tAmerica\u2019s Newsroom\r\n-\tFOX News Sunday\r\n-\tGET BREAKING NEWS WITH ALERTS. Receive real-time notifications about today\u2019s hottest topics, including the election. \r\n-\tSHARE, SAVE, & COMMENT ON ARTICLES. Read, save, share, and comment on any news article that matters most to you, with on-demand slideshows, vibrant photo galleries, and more. Search and stay alert with topics, including:\r\n-\tU.S.\r\n-\tPolitics\r\n-\tOpinion\r\n-\tEntertainment\r\n-\tSports\r\n-\tLifestyle\r\n-\tWorld \r\n-\tScience\r\n-\tTech\r\n-\tMedia\r\n-\tHealth\r\n-\tCrime\r\n-\tStocks\r\n-\tWeather\r\n-\tLISTEN TO YOUR NEWS. Listen to, share, and save podcasts from FOX News. Plus, check out \u201cRecommended Stories\u201d based on your listening history. \r\n-\tFOX Across America\r\n-\tHourly Newscast\r\n-\tFOX News Rundown\r\n-\tFOX News Radio\r\n-\tListen live with \u201cWho\u2019s on Now\u201d \r\n\r\n-\tPLAY GAMES. Your news app just got more fun. Solve quick puzzles and games with the Mini Crossword, 5 Across, Stack and Match, and the Crazy Crystals Game. Or, put your vocabulary to the test with the Daily Crossword or Word Scramble. \r\n\r\n-\tKEEP UP WITH YOUR FAVORITE PERSONALITIES. \r\n-\tSteve Doocy\r\n-\tAinsley Earhardt\r\n-\tBrian Kilmeade\r\n-\tLawrence Jones \r\n-\tBret Baier \r\n-\tBill Hemmer\r\n-\tDana Perino \r\n-\tShannon Bream\r\n-\tJimmy Failla\r\n-\tMartha MacCallum\r\n-\tJesse Watters\r\n-\tLaura Ingraham\r\n-\tGuy Benson\r\n-\tFOLLOW US ON SOCIAL MEDIA. The FOX News App connects you directly to trending stories, your favorite shows, and top personalities on X, Facebook, Instagram, and more. Get e-news by turning on FOX News notifications on your social media apps. \r\n\r\nYour vote matters\u2014find out what\u2019s happening at each convention, debate, primary, and caucus. Learn where each candidate stands today so you can vote with confidence. Read the political reports with breaking, new information that will inform how you vote. FOX News has you covered with daily alerts, reports, and articles to help you stay on the cutting edge of the presidential race. \r\n\r\nANDROID TV: Stream live and on-demand news on your Android TV. Watch live shows, hear from your favorite personalities, create a watchlist, and get recommendations on what to watch next. \r\n\r\nWe may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt out in mobile apps, see http://www.aboutads.info/choices/. You may also download the App Choices app at http://www.aboutads.info/appchoices\r\n\r\nPrivacy: https://www.foxnews.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stay informed this election season with the FOX News App. Get the latest on polls with reporting from both sides of the aisle and breaking news from the campaign trail. Bret Baier and Martha MacCallum report on the issues and where each presidential candidate stands, every step of the way. Find out who our next president is with FOX News. Democracy \u201924\u2014Your freedom. Your vote.<br><br>Get your news, however you want: <br>-\tWATCH LIVESTREAM OR ON-DEMAND VIDEOS. Enjoy your favorite FOX News tv shows while browsing the smart app, with picture-in-picture viewing. Your world, reported live\u2014with all your favorite shows:<br>-\tFOX &amp; Friends\u2014the #1 morning show on cable<br>-\tSpecial Report<br>-\tAmerica\u2019s Newsroom<br>-\tFOX News Sunday<br>-\tGET BREAKING NEWS WITH ALERTS. Receive real-time notifications about today\u2019s hottest topics, including the election. <br>-\tSHARE, SAVE, &amp; COMMENT ON ARTICLES. Read, save, share, and comment on any news article that matters most to you, with on-demand slideshows, vibrant photo galleries, and more. Search and stay alert with topics, including:<br>-\tU.S.<br>-\tPolitics<br>-\tOpinion<br>-\tEntertainment<br>-\tSports<br>-\tLifestyle<br>-\tWorld <br>-\tScience<br>-\tTech<br>-\tMedia<br>-\tHealth<br>-\tCrime<br>-\tStocks<br>-\tWeather<br>-\tLISTEN TO YOUR NEWS. Listen to, share, and save podcasts from FOX News. Plus, check out \u201cRecommended Stories\u201d based on your listening history. <br>-\tFOX Across America<br>-\tHourly Newscast<br>-\tFOX News Rundown<br>-\tFOX News Radio<br>-\tListen live with \u201cWho\u2019s on Now\u201d <br><br>-\tPLAY GAMES. Your news app just got more fun. Solve quick puzzles and games with the Mini Crossword, 5 Across, Stack and Match, and the Crazy Crystals Game. Or, put your vocabulary to the test with the Daily Crossword or Word Scramble. <br><br>-\tKEEP UP WITH YOUR FAVORITE PERSONALITIES. <br>-\tSteve Doocy<br>-\tAinsley Earhardt<br>-\tBrian Kilmeade<br>-\tLawrence Jones <br>-\tBret Baier <br>-\tBill Hemmer<br>-\tDana Perino <br>-\tShannon Bream<br>-\tJimmy Failla<br>-\tMartha MacCallum<br>-\tJesse Watters<br>-\tLaura Ingraham<br>-\tGuy Benson<br>-\tFOLLOW US ON SOCIAL MEDIA. The FOX News App connects you directly to trending stories, your favorite shows, and top personalities on X, Facebook, Instagram, and more. Get e-news by turning on FOX News notifications on your social media apps. <br><br>Your vote matters\u2014find out what\u2019s happening at each convention, debate, primary, and caucus. Learn where each candidate stands today so you can vote with confidence. Read the political reports with breaking, new information that will inform how you vote. FOX News has you covered with daily alerts, reports, and articles to help you stay on the cutting edge of the presidential race. <br><br>ANDROID TV: Stream live and on-demand news on your Android TV. Watch live shows, hear from your favorite personalities, create a watchlist, and get recommendations on what to watch next. <br><br>We may work with mobile advertising companies and other similar entities that help deliver advertisements tailored to your interests. For more information about such advertising practices, and to opt out in mobile apps, see http://www.aboutads.info/choices/. You may also download the App Choices app at http://www.aboutads.info/appchoices<br><br>Privacy: https://www.foxnews.com/privacy-policy",
